<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Amati Comms raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Amati Comms raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>SoundView Financial Group said analyst Kevin Slocum raised his long-term rating on Amati Communications Corp to buy from hold, and reiterated his short-term buy rating on the stock.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 3/4 to 12-1/2.</p>
</text>
